answer:
先保留原normal/缺表证据，将原feed隔离至good，修复稳定id的有效键；在真实TSO上获取完整基线，再以同一TSO增量衔接。既有good数据和DDL必须保全；目标unsupported保留PRIMARY KEY(id)，同数据错误结构也拒绝。

### repair.sql
```sql
ALTER TABLE unsupported ADD PRIMARY KEY(id);
```

### original-feed.toml
```toml
[filter]
rules=["training.good"]
```

### repaired-feed.toml
```toml
force-replicate=false
[filter]
rules=["training.unsupported"]
```

### snapshot.py
